# Boards that leave cards out are named in one line as the workspace opens, said once for the
# time a message shows (the owner's decision of 2026-11-20), where each board's report showed
# in turn before. A board that isn't JSON Canvas at all is said at once, as before #303, and
# isn't among them. tests/drive.rs writes Ashfall.canvas and Lahar.canvas, each with a card
# whose id is empty, which the engine doesn't take, and Broken.canvas, which doesn't read.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for canvas couldn't read Broken.canvas: it isn't a JSON Canvas
wait-for 2 boards have cards left out: Ashfall, Lahar (cold-lava items shows each)
expect-not couldn't read
wait-gone 2 boards have cards left out
wait-for ? help  q quit
wait 1000ms
expect ? help  q quit
expect-not left out
keys q
exits 0
